cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PureEdgeSim in your research, please cite the papers below rather than the repository itself."
title: PureEdgeSim
abstract: >-
  PureEdgeSim is a discrete-event simulator for performance evaluation of cloud,
  fog, edge, and mist computing environments. It models computing nodes, network
  links, task generation including service graphs, mobility, energy depletion, and
  the orchestration of tasks across tiers, and reports delay, CPU utilization,
  network usage, energy consumption, and task failure reasons.
